Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.88,0:00:46.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这人脚步轻盈
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.38,0:00:48.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,像是个少年
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.17,0:00:50.26,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可步履坚韧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.67,0:00:52.01,Dialog,,0,0,0,,又像历尽沧桑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.89,0:00:58.43,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他到底是不是诡新郎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.34,0:03:40.80,Dialog,,0,0,0,,刚刚路上全是死狼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.01,0:03:42.01,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们没看见吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.42,0:03:44.43,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这 这山里也太邪门了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.84,0:03:46.76,Dialog,,0,0,0,,越邪门就越有货
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.30,0:03:48.56,Dialog,,0,0,0,,等赏金到手
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.68,0:03:50.60,Dialog,,0,0,0,,吃香喝辣还少得了你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.60,0:03:51.52,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那边是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.18,0:03:53.77,Dialog,,0,0,0,,诡新郎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.02,0:03:54.73,Dialog,,0,0,0,,给我追
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.36,0:03:58.36,Dialog,,0,0,0,,刚刚那人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.65,0:04:00.02,Dialog,,0,0,0,,到底是不是诡新郎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.15,0:04:02.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,若是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.53,0:04:04.70,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那山中狼群应该是他的属下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.41,0:04:07.57,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但见了他为何怕成那样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.78,0:04:10.91,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这阵法应该也是诡新郎布下的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.37,0:04:12.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,却被他一脚踩碎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.54,0:04:14.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可若他不是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.21,0:04:16.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,又为何来劫花轿
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.59,0:04:24.51,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那边是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.98,0:04:39.98,Dialog,,0,0,0,,明光庙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.07,0:04:41.86,Dialog,,0,0,0,,谢谢掌柜
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.40,0:04:42.86,Dialog,,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.19,0:04:45.11,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不知离这儿最近的明光庙怎么走
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.57,0:04:46.57,Dialog,,0,0,0,,明光庙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.78,0:04:48.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我们这儿没有明光庙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.78,0:04:50.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.12,0:04:51.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么会
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.16,0:05:41.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一 二 三
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.76,0:05:49.93,Dialog,,0,0,0,,十五 十六 十七
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.22,0:05:52.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那失踪的新娘
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.72,0:05:53.89,Dialog,,0,0,0,,莫非全在这儿了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.64,0:07:19.47,Dialog,,0,0,0,,冲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.64,0:07:20.85,Dialog,,0,0,0,,追拿诡新郎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.85,0:07:21.89,Dialog,,0,0,0,,为民除害
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.10,0:07:24.23,Dialog,,0,0,0,,赏金平分 人人有份
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.90,0:07:28.44,Dialog,,0,0,0,,姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.86,0:07:30.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你是被那诡新郎掳进山的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.86,0:07:31.32,Dialog,,0,0,0,,别怕
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.53,0:07:32.32,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我们来救你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.20,0:07:34.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,竟然是他们
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.07,0:07:37.28,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这儿有间明光庙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.66,0:07:38.37,Dialog,,0,0,0,,稀奇了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.37,0:07:39.12,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我还从来没见过
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.12,0:07:40.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,对啊 什么时候建的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.29,0:07:41.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,没听说过啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.29,0:07:42.12,Dialog,,0,0,0,,都站住别动
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.04,0:07:44.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.92,0:07:46.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你怎么是男的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.76,0:07:52.59,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.93,0:07:54.59,Dialog,,0,0,0,,新娘呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.59,0:07:56.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们来的路上可曾遇到什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.76,0:07:59.22,Dialog,,0,0,0,,老子凭什么告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.60,0:08:01.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,之前的账还没跟你算呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.65,0:08:14.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们来的路上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.11,0:08:17.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可曾遇到什么东西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.41,0:08:25.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们一路追着诡新郎上来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.42,0:08:26.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就遇到了我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.75,0:08:27.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么着
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.67,0:08:28.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你还不信
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.00,0:08:31.84,Dialog,,0,0,0,,和你分开后
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.34,0:08:33.46,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我们安顿好轿夫
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.76,0:08:34.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,顺着这条路过来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.13,0:08:36.47,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也未发现可疑之处
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.18,0:08:37.93,Dialog,,0,0,0,,搜完了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.22,0:08:39.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,附近什么都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.30,0:08:41.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那诡新郎莫非就在这群人里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.56,0:08:44.43,Dialog,,0,0,0,,各位 方才多有冒犯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.06,0:08:46.44,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但我刚和诡新郎交手
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.64,0:08:47.69,Dialog,,0,0,0,,它绝对走不远
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.35,0:08:50.31,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这两位小友来时没碰到它
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.69,0:08:52.69,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只怕它 混在了你们中间
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.69,0:08:53.40,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.40,0:08:53.90,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.90,0:08:55.53,Dialog,,0,0,0,,咱们每个人都有名有姓
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.86,0:08:57.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不信 你一个一个查
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.66,0:08:59.24,Dialog,,0,0,0,,南风
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.62,0:09:09.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.63,0:09:10.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,如何
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.75,0:09:13.71,Dialog,,0,0,0,,没有不认识的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.71,0:09:14.51,Dialog,,0,0,0,,都是熟人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.22,0:09:23.26,Dialog,,0,0,0,,看清楚了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.60,0:09:25.10,Dialog,,0,0,0,,诡新郎不在咱们里面
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.64,0:09:27.10,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不会附在谁身上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.02,0:09:29.02,Dialog,,0,0,0,,应该不会
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.56,0:09:30.77,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那是个实心的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.90,0:09:32.86,Dialog,,0,0,0,,它既然是凶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.36,0:09:34.90,Dialog,,0,0,0,,说不定能变换形态
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.40,0:09:37.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,它有可能变了模样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.07,0:09:39.28,Dialog,,0,0,0,,藏在他们其中
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.12,0:09:41.70,Dialog,,0,0,0,,如果这样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.70,0:09:42.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那就麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.78,0:09:43.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,谁在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.09,0:10:00.47,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么是你这丑八怪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.26,0:10:03.30,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我 我只是放心不下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.43,0:10:04.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,想上来看看
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.64,0:10:07.93,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们跟她一起上来的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.35,0:10:09.02,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不记得了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.19,0:10:09.81,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.27,0:10:10.90,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.02,0:10:12.56,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我们上来的时候没有她吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.94,0:10:14.02,Dialog,,0,0,0,,反正我没看到
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.40,0:10:15.15,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我也没有
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.44,0:10:18.19,Dialog,,0,0,0,,因为我是偷偷跟来的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.82,0:10:20.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你为什么会偷偷跟上来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.78,0:10:22.16,Dialog,,0,0,0,,难道是诡新郎假扮的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.70,0:10:23.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.95,0:10:25.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,公子 我真的是小萤
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.08,0:10:27.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我给你上过胭脂
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.25,0:10:28.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也给你梳过头
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.00,0:10:36.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么有这种喜好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.34,0:10:37.76,Dialog,,0,0,0,,真是异于常人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.01,0:10:39.76,Dialog,,0,0,0,,任务需要
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.26,0:10:41.09,Dialog,,0,0,0,,南风扶摇
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.09,0:10:41.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.84,0:10:44.43,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们还不快来帮我说句话
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.43,0:10:48.56,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你有没有什么想说的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.68,0:10:49.60,Dialog,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.06,0:10:51.73,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们可真够意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.31,0:10:53.69,Dialog,,0,0,0,,喂 快来呀
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.69,0:10:55.06,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这里面好多新娘
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.15,0:10:57.69,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哼 果然
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.15,0:11:00.78,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们就是想唬住我们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.03,0:11:02.11,Dialog,,0,0,0,,自个儿独占功劳
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.11,0:11:03.11,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好去领赏
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.32,0:11:04.53,Dialog,,0,0,0,,以为老子会上当
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.78,0:11:06.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,走 跟我进庙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.62,0:11:07.37,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不要乱跑
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.20,0:11:08.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,别听他的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.04,0:11:09.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,走走走
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.50,0:11:09.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就是 走
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.95,0:11:10.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快走
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.37,0:11:11.91,Dialog,,0,0,0,,走
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.08,0:11:13.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这群刁民
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.46,0:11:15.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,冷静
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.63,0:11:16.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,打了凡人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.92,0:11:18.46,Dialog,,0,0,0,,要是被哪个监察的神官发现
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.46,0:11:19.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可就不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.80,0:11:23.89,Dialog,,0,0,0,,果然新娘都在这里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.89,0:11:24.89,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这么多啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.89,0:11:25.55,Dialog,,0,0,0,,发财了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.55,0:11:26.51,Dialog,,0,0,0,,都是死人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.51,0:11:27.31,Dialog,,0,0,0,,凉透了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.72,0:11:29.27,Dialog,,0,0,0,,刚才她好像动了一下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.02,0:11:30.81,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.56,0:11:32.77,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我没瞎说
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.06,0:11:35.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,各位还是先出去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.61,0:11:36.81,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这殿后常年无风
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.90,0:11:37.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,尸气沉淀
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.11,0:11:39.15,Dialog,,0,0,0,,十分危险
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.15,0:11:41.78,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大家还是听这位公子的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.94,0:11:43.07,Dialog,,0,0,0,,先出去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.20,0:11:43.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.62,0:11:46.37,Dialog,,0,0,0,,邪门儿了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.82,0:11:48.28,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这些姑娘死了几十年
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.28,0:11:48.99,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还没烂
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.99,0:11:49.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,会不会闹鬼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.87,0:11:50.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,管他的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.04,0:11:52.16,Dialog,,0,0,0,,把尸体运下山去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.46,0:11:54.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,她们家里人还不照样得出钱买
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.00,0:11:57.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,紧着新鲜的挑
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.63,0:11:59.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太老的家里人早就没了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.80,0:12:01.01,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就别费那个劲了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.34,0:12:04.93,Dialog,,0,0,0,,别揭
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.18,0:12:06.84,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那盖头能阻隔尸气和阳气
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.10,0:12:10.01,Dialog,,0,0,0,,妈呀
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.10,0:12:11.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这小娘儿美上天了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.89,0:12:14.06,Dialog,,0,0,0,,死了真可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.31,0:12:15.44,Dialog,,0,0,0,,长得还挺好看的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.06,0:12:21.36,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这 看久了还阴飕飕的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.36,0:12:22.69,Dialog,,0,0,0,,瞧你这怂样
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.11,0:12:23.78,Dialog,,0,0,0,,让开
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.66,0:12:34.37,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.71,0:12:35.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不要这样
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.08,0:12:37.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么又是你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.38,0:12:38.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,别碍老子的事儿
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.25,0:12:41.30,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们这样是要遭天谴的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.88,0:12:44.59,Dialog,,0,0,0,,切 丑人多作怪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.97,0:12:49.55,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.56,0:12:52.56,Dialog,,0,0,0,,谁砸我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.32,0:13:09.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是我 是我不小心
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.12,0:13:13.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,在那 是他
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.58,0:13:15.12,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是那个缠着绷带的丑八怪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.50,0:13:17.96,Dialog,,0,0,0,,诡新郎 别跑
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.34,0:13:27.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不 他不是诡新郎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.43,0:13:29.84,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们不要伤害他
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.05,0:13:32.31,Dialog,,0,0,0,,跟我去抓那丑八怪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.31,0:13:33.39,Dialog,,0,0,0,,下山领赏
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.56,0:13:34.27,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这气味
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.19,0:13:42.52,Dialog,,0,0,0,,危险 别进去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.44,0:13:44.15,Dialog,,0,0,0,,小彭
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.15,0:13:45.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不入虎穴焉得虎子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.78,0:13:46.86,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他不追 我们追
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.15,0:13:48.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,走
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.12,0:13:59.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.26,0:14:07.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,血
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.05,0:14:08.76,Dialog,,0,0,0,,血
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.88,0:14:10.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,到处都是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.43,0:14:17.60,Dialog,,0,0,0,,别怕 血不是他们的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.94,0:14:29.11,Dialog,,0,0,0,,火把借我下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.17,0:14:42.71,Dialog,,0,0,0,,树上挂着的是人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.83,0:14:45.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这些血都是从尸体上滴下来的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.59,0:14:48.84,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么这么多尸体啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.59,0:14:53.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,没想到诡新郎一个凶
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.39,0:14:55.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,竟然跟青鬼有关
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.35,0:14:57.26,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这下不好办了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.02,0:14:58.93,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们说谁
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.77,0:15:01.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一个境界接近绝的大鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.94,0:15:03.06,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这倒挂尸林
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.31,0:15:04.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是他最爱的把戏
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.90,0:15:05.77,Dialog,,0,0,0,,鄙奴来袭后
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.07,0:15:07.11,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我们分成了两路
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.78,0:15:08.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,从方位看
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.94,0:15:11.70,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子殿下上来时应当途经了此处
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.66,0:15:14.24,Dialog,,0,0,0,,殿下之前没注意到什么吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.99,0:15:17.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.99,0:15:20.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我在花轿上遇到了一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.66,0:15:22.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.09,0:15:33.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你说这山中迷阵凶险万分
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.18,0:15:35.72,Dialog,,0,0,0,,竟被他随意踏破
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.93,0:15:38.76,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们口中这位近绝青鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.27,0:15:40.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,会不会就是他
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.72,0:15:41.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,说不准
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.81,0:15:43.06,Dialog,,0,0,0,,此人有什么特征吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.77,0:15:44.60,Dialog,,0,0,0,,银蝶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.73,0:15:46.86,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什么样的银蝶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.94,0:15:49.44,Dialog,,0,0,0,,似银又似水晶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.95,0:15:54.07,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不似活物
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.28,0:15:56.28,Dialog,,0,0,0,,走 马上走
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.45,0:15:57.66,Dialog,,0,0,0,,诡新郎尚未解决
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.66,0:15:58.37,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不能走
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.49,0:16:01.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,诡新郎只是个凶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.29,0:16:03.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,青鬼也不过是个近绝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.08,0:16:06.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你可知那银蝶的主人是何等来头
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.00,0:16:07.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我不知
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.34,0:16:09.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你说
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.46,0:16:11.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,没空解释了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.42,0:16:13.05,Dialog,,0,0,0,,总之现在的情况你应付不了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.05,0:16:14.26,Dialog,,0,0,0,,先回天界报告此事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.97,0:16:15.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那你先去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.56,0:16:21.85,Dialog,,0,0,0,,第一  他并未流露恶意
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.56,0:16:25.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,第二 若他真如你所说的那般可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.64,0:16:27.23,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就更不能丢下其他人不管
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.31,0:16:29.32,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我和南风留下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.69,0:16:31.78,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你回去 帮我搬个救兵吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.65,0:16:36.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,抓住诡新郎啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.20,0:16:39.99,Dialog,,0,0,0,,过来吧你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.79,0:16:42.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.83,0:16:44.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这次可有钱分了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.83,0:16:47.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,干得好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.88,0:16:48.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,给你记头功
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.04,0:16:50.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,兄弟们 下山分赏去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.92,0:16:52.76,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们弄错了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.96,0:16:54.09,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他不是诡新郎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.38,0:16:56.93,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他真的什么都没有做过
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.93,0:16:58.05,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就是一个普通的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.05,0:16:59.22,Dialog,,0,0,0,,普通的什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.72,0:17:01.06,Dialog,,0,0,0,,普通的丑八怪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.26,0:17:02.26,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我倒要看看
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.39,0:17:03.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这怪物长什么样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.27,0:17:06.19,Dialog,,0,0,0,,才这么爱抢女人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.81,0:17:08.40,Dialog,,0,0,0,,看看 看看
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.61,0:17:12.27,Dialog,,0,0,0,,够了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.11,0:17:17.07,Dialog,,0,0,0,,公子 帮帮我们
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.25,0:17:26.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他不是诡新郎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.79,0:17:29.12,Dialog,,0,0,0,,真正的诡新郎应该还在附近
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.25,0:17:31.96,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.21,0:17:34.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我就说你们怎么古里古怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.88,0:17:37.01,Dialog,,0,0,0,,原来全是跟诡新郎串通好的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.93,0:17:38.47,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.84,0:17:40.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我都看见了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.59,0:17:41.60,Dialog,,0,0,0,,庙里的死人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.85,0:17:43.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就是你们干的好事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.47,0:17:44.01,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.22,0:17:45.85,Dialog,,0,0,0,,表面替天行道
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.98,0:17:48.06,Dialog,,0,0,0,,背地里干些谋财害命的勾当
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.39,0:17:49.94,Dialog,,0,0,0,,今天老子就要为民除
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.04,0:18:12.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,此地不宜久留
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.38,0:18:13.46,Dialog,,0,0,0,,先离开再说
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.43,0:18:21.26,Dialog,,0,0,0,,对 对不起公子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.64,0:18:22.93,Dialog,,0,0,0,,给你添麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.68,0:18:24.47,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可有受伤
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.35,0:18:26.52,Dialog,,0,0,0,,托公子的福
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.89,0:18:27.85,Dialog,,0,0,0,,没有大碍
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.27,0:18:32.52,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那你能告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.52,0:18:34.36,Dialog,,0,0,0,,树林中挂的尸体
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.90,0:18:38.40,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我不知道怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.69,0:18:40.15,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但肯定和他无关
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.24,0:18:44.16,Dialog,,0,0,0,,小萤姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.53,0:18:46.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这孩子到底是何身份
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.33,0:18:52.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他之前住在与君山里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.63,0:18:53.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,饿急了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.42,0:18:54.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就下山偷吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.38,0:18:57.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一次他刚好偷到我家
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.38,0:18:58.46,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我看他可怜
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.67,0:18:59.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,脸上还有伤
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.22,0:19:01.76,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就找布给他包上了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.59,0:19:03.80,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他生得丑陋
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.97,0:19:05.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也不太会说话
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.60,0:19:06.85,Dialog,,0,0,0,,村里人害怕他
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.06,0:19:08.02,Dialog,,0,0,0,,见了就打
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.02,0:19:11.02,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我只能把他带回山里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.44,0:19:13.52,Dialog,,0,0,0,,隔三差五送点吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.77,0:19:16.15,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我也是放心不下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.15,0:19:17.78,Dialog,,0,0,0,,才偷偷跟上来的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.53,0:19:20.32,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大家都说他是诡新郎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.32,0:19:22.57,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可他真的不是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.11,0:19:23.78,Dialog,,0,0,0,,公子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.16,0:19:25.16,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你要信我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.91,0:19:26.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,对了 小萤姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.08,0:19:27.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我有个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.45,0:19:29.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,除了山上这间
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.00,0:19:32.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这附近还建过其他的明光庙吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.12,0:19:34.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这个
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.29,0:19:37.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,以前是建过
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.84,0:19:38.80,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可不知怎的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.13,0:19:40.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,都失了火
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.80,0:19:41.80,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有人说
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.92,0:19:43.93,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怕是明光将军镇不住这里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.93,0:19:45.51,Dialog,,0,0,0,,才换了南阳将军
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.43,0:19:47.22,Dialog,,0,0,0,,小萤姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.60,0:19:48.85,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们呆在此地不要动
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.93,0:19:51.60,Dialog,,0,0,0,,南风 借我点法力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.89,0:19:53.44,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.81,0:19:54.77,Dialog,,0,0,0,,待会儿再解释
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.15,0:19:56.23,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我们先回明光殿
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.11,0:20:02.78,Dialog,,0,0,0,,等等 你们不能走
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.07,0:20:03.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这里这么危险
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.11,0:20:04.78,Dialog,,0,0,0,,万一出事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.86,0:20:05.57,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我们怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.70,0:20:06.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就是就是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.30,0:20:23.76,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我们回明光殿做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.80,0:20:26.76,Dialog,,0,0,0,,把里面的十八个新娘给镇住
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.64,0:20:29.39,Dialog,,0,0,0,,嗯 不是十七个吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.81,0:20:32.98,Dialog,,0,0,0,,之前是十七个
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.52,0:20:34.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但现在有十八个了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.77,0:20:35.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.35,0:20:36.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,其中有一个
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.77,0:20:37.77,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就是诡新郎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.87,0:20:50.49,Dialog,,0,0,0,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.33,0:20:57.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.29,0:20:59.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我还是没懂
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.63,0:21:00.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,为什么多出一个
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.17,0:21:04.09,Dialog,,0,0,0,,之前我们叫村民互相确认过
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.38,0:21:05.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,没有陌生面孔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.30,0:21:07.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你和扶摇也在附近搜过
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.26,0:21:09.80,Dialog,,0,0,0,,并无诡新郎的踪迹
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.30,0:21:12.18,Dialog,,0,0,0,,若绷带少年不是诡新郎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.68,0:21:14.31,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那诡新郎到底去哪儿了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.14,0:21:15.77,Dialog,,0,0,0,,难道
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.02,0:21:16.52,Dialog,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.23,0:21:18.48,Dialog,,0,0,0,,它可能根本没走
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.94,0:21:20.23,Dialog,,0,0,0,,而是一直藏在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.77,0:21:21.57,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我追的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.32,0:21:23.90,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只是一团黑雾而已
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.28,0:21:26.15,Dialog,,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.65,0:21:27.86,Dialog,,0,0,0,,之前它进来时
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.11,0:21:29.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我混在新娘中
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.49,0:21:30.78,Dialog,,0,0,0,,没有被立刻发现
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.45,0:21:32.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那反过来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.66,0:21:33.70,Dialog,,0,0,0,,它混在新娘里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.20,0:21:35.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也很难被我们察觉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.04,0:21:36.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,小萤说
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.50,0:21:39.71,Dialog,,0,0,0,,附近在建的明光庙屡屡失火
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.08,0:21:41.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这不是巧合
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.42,0:21:42.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,应该是人为
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.34,0:21:45.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,为什么放火烧庙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.38,0:21:47.80,Dialog,,0,0,0,,通常是因为恨
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.51,0:21:50.05,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可为何这与君山内
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.30,0:21:51.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,又有一座被迷阵封锁
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.14,0:21:53.89,Dialog,,0,0,0,,保存极好的明光庙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.31,0:21:56.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,并且庙内神像又雕得极好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.94,0:22:01.06,Dialog,,0,0,0,,加之见不得穿着嫁衣的女子路过与君山时
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.06,0:22:02.27,Dialog,,0,0,0,,脸上带笑
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.94,0:22:05.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这难道不是在嫉妒其他新娘的幸福吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.40,0:22:08.70,Dialog,,0,0,0,,把一切联系起来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.36,0:22:10.53,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只有一个可能
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.70,0:22:17.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,嫉妒
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.29,0:22:19.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,独占
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.96,0:22:20.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,恨
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.71,0:22:24.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你是说
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.55,0:22:25.84,Dialog,,0,0,0,,诡新郎不是新郎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.55,0:22:29.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,而是一个求而不得
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.80,0:22:31.26,Dialog,,0,0,0,,因爱生恨的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.93,0:22:33.80,Dialog,,0,0,0,,女子
